#created by Duel Circuit - Lab Coat Lyle (Scientist-Turtle burn, 2004)
#era 2004
#tier Alley headliner, Nyx's Table (docs/dev/HEADLINERS-2026-11-01.md)
#about Magical Scientist pays 1000 Life Points to call a Fusion from the Extra Deck, and Catapult Turtle throws it at you for half its ATK. Seven calls is a duel's worth of damage, and Lyle never has to attack.
#why Magical Scientist is Forbidden today and Catapult Turtle has long been once per turn; in April 2004 the Scientist was at one and the Turtle had no limit (the 2004 texts: Catapult Turtle, Sangan, Witch).
#source Authored for Nyx's Table from the 2004 Scientist-Turtle lists: three Catapult Turtle, every way back from the GY for the one Scientist, Scapegoat and the searchers for the Turtle's Tribute, fifteen Level 6 Fusions to throw
